{{Top}}
'''Helen Player''' was one of the guests invited to an upcoming dinner for the governor of [[Hanna City|Hanna]], hosted by [[Senator]] [[Mon Mothma]] and her husband [[Perrin Fertha]].<ref name="Aldhani">{{Andor|Aldhani (episode)}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The character shares their name with [[Helen Player (person)|Helen Player]], who worked as a set dec buyer on the television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'', and a set decoration assistant buyer on the [[2019]] film {{Film|9}}.<ref name="Rise">{{Film|IX}}</ref>

